OffensIA orchestrates external tool engines that are consumed as separate
dependencies at install time (see deps/engines.yaml). Those dependencies are not
included in this repository; each retains its own license and NOTICE files inside
its own directory under deps/ when provisioned. OffensIA does not modify or
redistribute their source, and their notices are preserved where they are
installed.
